.html#vip-floorplan-modal","lines":[{"text":"Foxridge Homes"},{"text":"Westbrooke at Willoughby"},{"text":"Request Floorplans & Pricing →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/new-construction-presales-in-langley-bc.html#vip-floorplan-modal","lines":[{"text":"New Story Homes"},{"text":"Willow Living"},{"text":"Request Floorplans & Pricing →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/new-construction-presales-in-langley-bc.html#vip-floorplan-modal","lines":[{"text":"Zenterra Developments"},{"text":"Windsor"},{"text":"Request Floorplans & Pricing →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/new-construction-presales-in-langley-bc.html#vip-floorplan-modal","lines":[{"text":"Langley Presale Project"},{"text":"Winston Terraces"},{"text":"Request Floorplans & Pricing →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/new-construction-presales-in-langley-bc.html#vip-floorplan-modal","lines":[{"text":"Langley Presale Project"},{"text":"20061 Fraser Highway"},{"text":"Request Floorplans & Pricing →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/new-construction-presales-in-langley-bc.html#vip-floorplan-modal","lines":[{"text":"Zail Properties"},{"text":"20164 81A Avenue"},{"text":"Request Floorplans & Pricing →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/new-construction-presales-in-langley-bc.html#vip-floorplan-modal","lines":[{"text":"CastleHill Homes"},{"text":"20329 80th Avenue"},{"text":"Request Floorplans & Pricing →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/new-construction-presales-in-langley-bc.html#vip-floorplan-modal","lines":[{"text":"Langley Presale Project"},{"text":"4750 228 Street"},{"text":"Request Floorplans & Pricing →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/new-construction-presales-in-langley-bc.html#vip-floorplan-modal","lines":[{"text":"StreetSide"},{"text":"6951 204 Street"},{"text":"Request Floorplans & Pricing →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/new-construction-presales-in-langley-bc.html#vip-floorplan-modal","lines":[{"text":"Essence Properties"},{"text":"8120 200A Street"},{"text":"Request Floorplans & Pricing →"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Worth knowing"}]},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"The tax advantage"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Two breaks apply to new construction that don't exist on resale. Together they're worth five figures on a typical Langley condo, and most buyers never factor them in."}]},{"t":"h","level":3,"text":"Transfer tax: often $0"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"BC's Newly Built Home Exemption removes property transfer tax on qualifying new homes up to $1,100,000, partial to $1,150,000. You don't need to be a first-time buyer."}]},{"t":"h","level":3,"text":"First-timer? GST can be zero"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"The federal First-Time Home Buyers' GST Rebate became law in March 2026 — 100% of the 5% GST back on a qualifying home up to $1 million, max $50,000."}]},{"t":"h","level":3,"text":"Seven days to change your mind"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"After the developer signs, BC law gives you seven days to cancel for any reason, no penalty. Resale gets three business days and a fee."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Run the numbers"}]},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"What it really costs"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Worked examples for a first-time buyer purchasing a principal residence, at a 15% total deposit. Your own numbers will differ — ask me and I'll run them properly."}]},{"t":"list","items":[[{"t":"Purchase price"}],[{"t":"Deposits"}],[{"t":"GST 5%"}],[{"t":"GST rebate"}],[{"t":"Transfer tax"}],[{"t":"Due at completion"}],[{"t":"$600,000"}],[{"t":"$90,000"}],[{"t":"$30,000"}],[{"t":"− $30,000"}],[{"t":"$0"}],[{"t":"$2,000"}],[{"t":"$749,000"}],[{"t":"$112,350"}],[{"t":"$37,450"}],[{"t":"− $37,450"}],[{"t":"$0"}],[{"t":"$2,000"}],[{"t":"$900,000"}],[{"t":"$135,000"}],[{"t":"$45,000"}],[{"t":"− $45,000"}],[{"t":"$0"}],[{"t":"$2,000"}],[{"t":"$1,000,000"}],[{"t":"$150,000"}],[{"t":"$50,000"}],[{"t":"− $50,000"}],[{"t":"$0"}],[{"t":"$2,000"}],[{"t":"$1,100,000"}],[{"t":"$165,000"}],[{"t":"$55,000"}],[{"t":"− $40,000"}],[{"t":"$0"}],[{"t":"$17,000"}],[{"t":"$1,250,000"}],[{"t":"$187,500"}],[{"t":"$62,500"}],[{"t":"− $25,000"}],[{"t":"$23,000"}],[{"t":"$62,500"}]]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Deposits are paid in instalments during construction, not up front. \"Due at completion\" covers tax plus roughly $2,000 in legal and adjustments; it excludes your down payment and mortgage. Buying as an investment rather than a residence removes both the exemption and the rebate. Estimates only — confirm with your lawyer and accountant. See the"},{"t":"Buying guide","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/buying.html"},{"t":"for more context on purchasing in Langley."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"The process"}]},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"How a presale works"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"From \"should I do this\" to picking up keys is realistically two to four years."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"01"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Sort your financing"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Tell your broker you're looking at presales — lenders treat new construction differently and some offer far longer rate holds."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"02"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Register with me first"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Most developers require your agent present on your first presentation-centre visit. They pay the commission either way."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"03"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Offer & first deposit"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"You sign the developer's contract. Your deposit is held in trust, not handed to the developer."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"04"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Use all seven days"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"BC law gives you seven days to cancel for any reason. Have a lawyer read everything inside that window."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"05"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Read the disclosure statement"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Unit counts, the developer's record, the outside completion date, and what happens if it runs late."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"06"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Pay deposits on schedule"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Diarise every instalment date the day you sign. Missing one can put you in breach."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"07"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Ignore the estimated date"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Six months to a year late is normal. Never give notice or firm up a sale based on an estimate."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"08"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Deficiency walkthrough"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Photograph everything. What you miss here gets much harder to fix afterwards."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"09"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Complete and move in"},{"t":"GST and transfer tax are calculated now. First mortgage payment is about 30 days later."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Straight talk"}]},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Not right for everyone"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Things you won't hear at a presentation centre."}]},{"t":"h","level":3,"text":"Usually not cheaper"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Per square foot, presales generally cost more than a comparable resale condo. You're paying for new, not for a discount."}]},{"t":"h","level":3,"text":"Values drop? You still complete"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"There's no walking away after the seven-day window because the market moved."}]},{"t":"h","level":3,"text":"You can't see the actual home"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Display suites are typically upgraded, and parking is usually assigned near completion."}]},{"t":"h","level":3,"text":"Be certain you can close"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Potentially three years out, at whatever rates exist then. That's the real risk."}]},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Ask me about any project"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"I'll send current pricing, the deposit schedule, and the completion timeline — and I'll tell you honestly if a presale isn't the right fit for your situation."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Call or text 604-928-1361","h":"tel:+16049281361"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Email me","h":"mailto:jaredgibbons@royallepage.ca?subject=Langley%20new%20construction%20enquiry"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"General information only, not legal, tax, or financial advice. Prices, availability, deposit structures and completion dates come from developers and change without notice — confirm against the disclosure statement and your own contract. Tax rules change, so confirm current figures with your lawyer or accountant before you sign. Renderings are the property of their respective developers and final construction may differ."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"More reading:"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"BC new home GST guide","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/bc-new-home-gst-guide-rates-rebates-what-youll-owe-8967272"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"·"},{"t":"The new homes GST waiver plan","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/new-homes-gst-waiver-government-plan-2025-8491859"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"·"},{"t":"South Surrey presales & new construction","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/south-surrey-new-construction-presales.html"}]},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Frequently asked questions","id":"faqs"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Do I pay property transfer tax on a Langley presale?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Usually not on a principal residence. BC's Newly Built Home Exemption removes property transfer tax on qualifying new homes up to $1,100,000, with a partial exemption to $1,150,000. You don't need to be a first-time buyer."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Can a first-time buyer get the GST back on a new condo?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Yes. The federal First-Time Home Buyers' GST Rebate became law in March 2026 and returns 100% of the 5% GST on a qualifying new home up to $1 million (maximum $50,000), phasing out to $1.5 million. See my"},{"t":"BC new home GST guide","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/bc-new-home-gst-guide-rates-rebates-what-youll-owe-8967272"},{"t":"."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"How much deposit do Langley presales need?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Most Langley projects ask for 10% to 20% in total, paid in two to four instalments during construction. The deposit is held in trust, not by the developer."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Can I cancel a presale after I sign?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Yes. Under BC's Real Estate Development Marketing Act you have seven days after signing (and receiving the disclosure statement) to cancel for any reason with no penalty."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Does it cost more to use a Realtor for a presale?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"No. The developer pays my commission either way, but most developers require your agent to be present at your first presentation-centre visit, so register with me before you go."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"What new home warranty comes with a presale?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"New homes in BC carry 2-5-10 home warranty coverage: 2 years on materials and labour, 5 years on the building envelope and 10 years on structure."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Which Langley areas have the most presales?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Willoughby and Latimer Heights have the most projects, followed by Langley City near the future SkyTrain stations. Fort Langley, Walnut Grove and Murrayville have fewer, smaller projects. I also cover"},{"t":"South Surrey presales","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/south-surrey-new-construction-presales.html"},{"t":"."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Written by"},{"t":"Jared Gibbons, REALTOR®","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/jared.html"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"· Royal LePage Little Oak Realty, Suite 201 - 15272 Croydon Dr, Surrey, BC ·"},{"t":"Call","h":"tel:+16049281361"},{"t":"or"},{"t":"text","h":"sms:+16049281361"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"604-928-1361"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Information is believed accurate but not guaranteed. Confirm tax, deposit and strata details with your lawyer and accountant before you sign."}]},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Search Langley homes"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Live MLS® listings, updated daily. Pick a home type, price range or neighbourhood."}]},{"t":"list","items":[[{"t":"All Langley homes","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/langley-homes-for-sale.html"}],[{"t":"Condos under $499K","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/langley-condos-under-499k.html"}],[{"t":"Condos under $399K","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/langley-condos-under-399k.html"}],[{"t":"Townhomes under $1.2M","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/langley-townhomes-under-1-2m.html"}],[{"t":"Homes under $1.8M","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/langley-homes-under-1-8m.html"}],[{"t":"Homes over $1.8M","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/langley-homes-over-1-8m.html"}],[{"t":"Open houses","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/langley-open-houses.html"}],[{"t":"Acreages","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/langley-acreages-for-sale.html"}],[{"t":"Farms","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/langley-farms-for-sale-acreages-agricultural-land-mls.html"}],[{"t":"Lots & land","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/langley-lots-land.html"}],[{"t":"Foreclosures & court sales","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/langley-foreclosures-court-ordered-sales.html"}],[{"t":"Neighbourhood guides","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/langley-neighbourhood-guides.html"}],[{"t":"South Surrey presales","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/south-surrey-new-construction-presales.html"}]]},{"t":"h","level":3,"text":"Langley neighbourhoods"},{"t":"list","items":[[{"t":"Brookswood","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/brookswood.html"}],[{"t":"Walnut Grove","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/walnut-grove.html"}],[{"t":"Willoughby","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/willoughby-heights.html"}],[{"t":"Murrayville","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/murrayville.html"}],[{"t":"Fort Langley","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/fort-langley.html"}],[{"t":"Aldergrove","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/aldergrove.html"}],[{"t":"Langley City","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/langley-city.html"}],[{"t":"Campbell Valley acreages","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/campbell-valley-acreages-farms-for-sale.html"}]]}],"forms":[],"iframes":[]}